5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A game of Werewolf! I'm so excited! Let's all try our best to find the wolf, okay? Who do you guys think looks the most suspicious already? Hehe!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"It's a bit too early to say who is suspicious, isn't it, Sakura? But I'm looking forward to playing with everyone. I hope we can all get along while we figure this out.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I agree with Minato. We don't have any clues yet, so guessing now is just reckless. Let's stay calm and see how everyone behaves before we start pointing fingers.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm with Takumi on this one! It's way too early to guess. But the excitement is real! Let's just chat for a bit and see if anyone lets something slip, okay?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems we are all in agreement. Since we have no information, the most logical approach is to observe. I'll be watching your reactions closely to see who is acting out of character.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you sound so serious! It's almost scary, hehe! But that's okay, I'll be watching you too! I wonder if the wolf is trying to act all calm and cool right now?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, you're always so energetic. I think Shion is just being careful. But I wonder... if the wolf is trying to hide, would they be quiet or try to lead the conversation?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, that's a good question. Usually, the wolf tries to blend in, but sometimes they try to control the flow to avoid suspicion. We just need to keep our eyes open and not trust anyone too easily.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,Exactly! We have to be careful. But let's not get too paranoid yet! Maybe we can talk about our favorite things to see if anyone gets nervous? That could be a fun way to observe!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Talking about favorites is a trivial distraction, Mio. While it might reveal personality, it rarely reveals a role. I prefer to focus on the logic of the claims we make once the game actually begins.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're such a party pooper! Hehe! But that's what makes it a challenge! I bet I can find a clue even in the ""trivial"" things. I'm going to be a super detective!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"A super detective, huh? That sounds like fun, Sakura. I'll try my best to help you, even if I'm not as confident as Shion. I wonder what kind of clues you'll find first.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, just don't get so carried away that you start accusing people without proof. We need a real strategy, not just a game of pretend. Let's focus on staying alert.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're always so strict! But you're right, we need a plan. Still, a little bit of fun makes the game better, don't you think? I'm just trying to keep the mood light!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Lightening the mood is a social tactic, but it doesn't change the facts. I'll allow the banter for now, but remember that the wolf is among us, likely enjoying this lack of focus.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, Shion is still being so grumpy! But you're right, the wolf might be laughing at us! I'll be extra careful and keep my eyes wide open. Good luck everyone, let's see what happens tomorrow!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,I hope everyone has a peaceful night. I'll be thinking about what we talked about today to see if I notice anything strange tomorrow. Let's all do our best to find the werewolf together!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'll be doing the same. Let's see who's still acting ""normal"" when the first result comes in. Sleep well, everyone, but don't let your guard down. I'm ready for whatever happens tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Mio,,"I'm ready too! I'll be dreaming of clues and mysteries! Goodnight everyone, and let's hope we wake up to some interesting information tomorrow morning! See you all then!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Goodnight. I will spend the night analyzing the patterns of your speech. Tomorrow, the masks will begin to slip, and I expect the truth to emerge through logic, not luck. See you all tomorrow.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
