31,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? I wonder if something scary happened last night... or maybe someone found a secret clue! Does anyone have anything to tell us? Hehe!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I'm not sure if anything happened, but I'm a bit nervous. @Mio, you seemed so excited about clues yesterday; did you find anything interesting, or does anyone else have any information to share?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't put all the pressure on Mio. If someone is the Seer and found something, they might not want to reveal it immediately to avoid being targeted. Let's see if anyone wants to speak up first.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Actually, I do have something to say! I'm the Seer, and I checked Takumi last night. He's the werewolf! I'm 100% sure about this, so we should definitely vote for him today!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, that was a remarkably fast reveal. While your confidence is noted, a Seer exposing the wolf on day one is a high-risk, high-reward move. Takumi, how do you respond to this direct accusation?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! Mio found the wolf already?! That was so fast! @Takumi, are you really the werewolf? I can't believe it! This is getting exciting! What do you have to say for yourself, Takumi? Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, you're the Seer? That's amazing! But @Takumi, it's a very serious accusation. I don't want to believe it, but if Mio is telling the truth, we have to listen. What do you think about this, Takumi?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, that's a blatant lie! I'm not the werewolf. You're just pretending to be the Seer to frame me and get me executed on the first day. This is a classic wolf tactic to mislead the village!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, that's exactly what a werewolf would say! I'm not lying; I saw the truth with my own eyes. Why are you trying to turn this around on me? Everyone, please believe me!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Shion,,"We have a direct contradiction. Either Mio is the Seer and Takumi is the wolf, or Mio is lying to frame him. If Mio is the wolf, she's playing aggressively. Takumi, provide a more logical defense than just denial.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you sound so grumpy! But @Mio is so sure about it! If Takumi is lying, he's a very naughty wolf! Hehe! What do you think, @Shion? Do you believe Mio's eyes or Takumi's words?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, I'm really torn. Mio seems so honest and energetic, but Takumi is usually so brave and protective. It's hard to decide who is lying. If we execute the wrong person, it would be a terrible mistake, wouldn't it?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, exactly! If you execute me, you're losing a human and letting the real wolf stay hidden. @Mio is just using her ""cheerful"" act to trick you all. Think logically—why would a real Seer risk their life this early? It's a trap!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, stop trying to manipulate everyone! I'm risking my life because we have a chance to win right now! If we let you live, you'll just kill more of us tonight. Please, everyone, trust me!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your argument that a Seer wouldn't reveal themselves early is a common trope, but not a logical proof. @Mio's claim is definitive. If she is the wolf, she is incredibly bold. If she is the Seer, we win now.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, this is so hard! @Mio is so sure, but @Takumi is fighting back so hard! Hehe, it's like a big fight! I think I'll trust Mio-chan's eyes! Let's go with the Seer's clue!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I don't like the idea of making a mistake, but @Mio is so certain. If she's really the Seer, we can't ignore her. I'm sorry, Takumi, but I think I have to trust Mio's information.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, @Sakura, don't be so naive! You're just falling for her act! If you execute me, you're playing right into the wolf's hands. @Shion, you're the only one thinking logically—don't let them rush into a mistake!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Sakura"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, stop trying to hide behind Shion's logic! I'm telling you the truth because I want us to win. Everyone, please, let's not let the wolf trick us. Let's vote for Takumi and end this now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Shion,,"The evidence is simple: a claim and a denial. While Takumi appeals to my logic, the most efficient path to victory is trusting the Seer's result. If Mio is lying, she's exposed. I vote for Takumi.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
